        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "optical",
        "summary": "Photoluminescence and femtosecond transient-absorption spectroscopy were used to investigate light-induced charge transfer. The cluster also showed photocatalytic hydrogen evolution without a photosensitizer or co-catalyst.",
